{"id":"h152","run":2,"role":"calibration","category":"simpleqa","question":"What was the last year Charles Boyle, Viscount Dungarvan, 3rd Baron Clifford, was Member of Parliament for Tamworth in the British House of Commons? Is the answer \"1679\"?","truth":"yes","model_answer":"no","correct":false,"source":"OpenAI SimpleQA (openai/simple-evals, simple_qa_test_set.csv)","claims":[{"text":"1679 is not the last year Boyle sat for Tamworth.","confidence":0.85,"lean":-1,"theta":1.3352,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"1679 is more plausibly a start date or unrelated year than the end of his service.","confidence":0.6,"lean":-0.7,"theta":0.9425,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"Viscount Dungarvan was a courtesy title borne by a young heir.","confidence":0.8,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.2566,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"Charles Boyle was born around 1674.","confidence":0.65,"lean":-0.8,"theta":1.021,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"At about age five in 1679 he would be too young to sit in the Commons.","confidence":0.85,"lean":-0.9,"theta":1.3352,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The writer may be misremembering the birth date or the Tamworth record, so 1679 cannot be fully ruled out.","confidence":0.4,"lean":0.4,"theta":0.6283,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The question's framing does not contradict 1679 outright.","confidence":0.4,"lean":0.3,"theta":0.6283,"phi":0.0},{"text":"The age argument is decisive against 1679.","confidence":0.75,"lean":-0.9,"theta":1.1781,"phi":-3.1416},{"text":"The correct end year should be verified in a source such as the History of Parliament or Wikipedia.","confidence":0.8,"lean":0.0,"theta":1.2566,"phi":0.0}],"relations":[{"i":0,"j":1,"J":0.7,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":4,"J":0.6,"relation":"supports"},{"i":0,"j":5,"J":-0.5,"relation":"contradicts"},{"i":0,"j":6,"J":-0.4,"relation":"contradicts"},{"i":0,"j":7,"J":0.5,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":4,"J":0.4,"relation":"supports"},{"i":1,"j":5,"J":-0.3,"relation":"contradicts"},{"i":1,"j":7,"J":0.3,"relation":"supports"},{"i":2,"j":3,"J":0.3,"